   "texto": [
    "+ this = **deste**, + this = **desta**, + esse = **desse**, + aquele = **daquele**.",
    "As «gostar» wears «de», you will hear it all the time: **Gosto deste vestido** (I like this dress), **gosto desta camisa** (I like this shirt)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The clothes",
   "texto": [
    "**A roupa** is «the clothes». **A camisa**, **o vestido**, **os sapatos**, **o casaco** (jacket or coat), **a saia** (skirt), **o chapéu** (hat).",
    "The pants are **as calças**, always in plural. The sports slippers are **as sapatilhas**.",
    "A false gift friend: in Portugal **a camisola** is «the sweater».",
    "To say that something is pimp or monkey, the Portuguese say **giro / gira**. **Olha!** = look!"
   ]
